<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE- NORIT H1 NET PROFIT UP 66 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>TABLE- NORIT H1 NET PROFIT UP 66 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>AMERSFOORT, Netherlands 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.13 vs   0.69</p>
<p>    Net profit			    13.8  vs   8.3</p>
<p>    Turnover			     213.9  vs 153.6</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    20.4  vs  12.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Carbon maker Norit NV said in April it expected</p>
<p>profits to show a major improvement in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
